{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0274","start":274,"end":276,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001879","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m013-0284","start":284,"end":288,"surface":"文王熊貲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001880","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p014","text":"文王二年，伐申過鄧，鄧人曰「楚王易取」，鄧侯不許也。六年，伐蔡，虜蔡哀侯以歸，已而釋之。楚彊，陵江漢閒小國，小國皆畏之。十一年，齊桓公始霸，楚亦始大。十二年，伐鄧，滅之。十三年，卒，子熊艱立，是爲莊敖。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001880","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"楚王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001880","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"鄧侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002043","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"蔡哀侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002004","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000235","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"熊艱","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001881","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m014-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"莊敖","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001881","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p097","text":"鬻熊之嗣，周封於楚。僻在荊蠻，蓽路藍縷。及通而霸，僭號曰武。文旣伐申，成亦赦許。子圉篡嫡，商臣殺父。天禍未悔，憑奸自怙。昭困奔亡，懷迫囚虜。頃襄、考烈，祚衰南土。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-s